        "heroIntro": "Every business has processes that consume staff time, create errors and depend on someone remembering to do them — often inside fragile spreadsheets that have outgrown their original purpose. We identify those processes and improve or automate them with the right mix of Excel, VBA, Power Automate and AI — so your team focuses on work that actually needs human judgement.",
